  "body_html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">6 октября в честь Дня среднего профессионального образования&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">на спортивной базе ОрГМУ в Зауральной роще прошли соревнования&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">среди обучающихся по программе СПО</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">Р</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">ебята преодолевали эстафеты, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">демонстрировали</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">ловкость и скорость, а главное — поддерживали друг друга.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">В</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">итоге т</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">ретье место — у группы С25СД\u001e04</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">, серебро&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">у </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">групп</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">ы</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">С25СД\u001e02</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">. А</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">бсолютные чемпионы — группа С25СД\u001e03</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial;\">.</span></p>",
